WEBVTT

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:31.093
little creatures in the garden

00:02:31.113 --> 00:02:32.951
as if I was greeting them.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:35.460
When you say "thank you,"

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:37.830
it creates a harmony between you

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:41.569
and the external condition
under observation.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.773
It helps you to bring
your attention inwards.

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:50.250
It may be initially just a word
running in your head

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:54.000
without a true feeling
of gratitude in your heart.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.373
A word is a sound,

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.763
and a sound is a vibration,